#. module: account_credit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_credit/models/credit_profile.py:0
msgid "A credit profile belongs to the commercial partner; record it on '%s'."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil de crédito pertenece al contacto comercial; regístrelo en '%s'."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:account_credit.constraint_credit_profile_partner_company_uniq
msgid "A customer has one credit profile per company."
msgstr "Un cliente tiene un perfil de crédito por compañía."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_credit.selection__credit_policy_rule__condition__exception_active
msgid "A dated exception is running"
msgstr "Hay una excepción con vigencia en curso"

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_res_bank__credit_exception
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_res_company__credit_exception
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_res_partner__credit_exception
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_res_users__credit_exception
msgid ""
"A dated exception is running on the profile. Setting it grants an exception "
"for the company's maximum; clearing it ends the exception."
msgstr ""
"Hay una excepción con vigencia en curso en el perfil. Marcarla otorga una "
"excepción por el máximo de la compañía; desmarcarla la termina."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_credit_profile__exception_until
msgid ""
"A dated exception lets the partner buy on credit regardless of grade and "
"policy until this day. It is never indefinite."
msgstr ""
"Una excepción con vigencia permite al cliente comprar a crédito sin importar"
" el grado ni la política hasta este día. Nunca es indefinida."

#. module: account_credit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_credit/models/credit_facility.py:0
msgid "A facility cannot end before it starts."
msgstr "Una línea de crédito no puede terminar antes de empezar."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:account_credit.constraint_credit_facility_positive_amount
msgid "A facility grants a positive amount."
msgstr "Una línea de crédito otorga un monto positivo."

#. module: account_credit
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_credit.action_credit_facility
msgid ""
"A facility grants an amount of credit for a period. The credit\n"
"                limit of a profile is its valid collateral plus every facility\n"
"                granting today."
msgstr ""
"Una línea otorga un monto de crédito por un periodo. El límite de\n"
"                crédito de un perfil es su colateral vigente más cada línea\n"
"                que otorga hoy."

#. module: account_credit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_credit/models/credit_grade.py:0
msgid "A grade's score range must lie within 0 and 100."
msgstr "El rango de puntaje de un grado debe estar entre 0 y 100."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_credit.selection__credit_policy_rule__condition__hold_active
msgid "A hold is open on the profile"
msgstr "Hay un bloqueo abierto en el perfil"

#. module: account_credit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_credit/models/credit_provision_matrix.py:0
msgid "A loss rate lies between 0 and 100."
msgstr "Una tasa de pérdida está entre 0 y 100."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:credit.grade,description:account_credit.credit_grade_default
msgid ""
"A material receivable past due beyond the company's default threshold, or in"
" legal process. Every credit sale needs a manager's authorization."
msgstr ""
"Una cuenta por cobrar material vencida más allá del umbral de incumplimiento"
" de la compañía, o en proceso legal. Toda venta a crédito requiere "
"autorización de un gerente."

#. module: account_credit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_credit/models/credit_provision_run.py:0
msgid "A posted run is not recomputed."
msgstr "Una corrida publicada no se recalcula."

#. module: account_credit
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_credit.action_credit_profile
msgid ""
"A profile is created the first time a customer is graded or buys on\n"
"                credit. It carries the grade, the measured payment behaviour, the\n"
"                exposure, the facilities and every decision taken."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil se crea la primera vez que un cliente recibe grado o compra a\n"
"                crédito. Lleva el grado, el comportamiento de pago medido, la\n"
"                exposición, las líneas y cada decisión tomada."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_credit_config__default_days
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_res_config_settings__credit_default_days
msgid ""
"A profile whose oldest open receivable is past due by this many days is in "
"default (Basel CRE36.69 uses 90)."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil cuya cuenta por cobrar abierta más antigua supera estos días de "
"vencimiento está en incumplimiento (Basilea CRE36.69 usa 90)."

#. module: account_credit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_credit_config__watch_days
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit.field_res_config_settings__credit_watch_days
msgid ""
"A profile whose oldest open receivable is past due by this many days is put "
"under watch."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil cuya cuenta por cobrar abierta más antigua supera estos días de "
"vencimiento pasa a vigilancia."

#. module: account_credit
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:account_credit.action_credit_review
msgid ""
"A review snapshots a profile's metrics and score, proposes a grade\n"
"                and a facility, and a credit manager decides."
msgstr ""
"Una revisión toma una instantánea de las métricas y el puntaje del perfil,\n"
"                propone un grado y una línea, y un gerente de crédito decide."

